  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC phase-out management plan (Stage II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Saint Lucia HCFC Phase Out Management Plan (Stage II, Second Tranche) is a strategic initiative aimed at reducing the use of HCFCs in Saint Lucia. this phase focuses on implementing regulatory measures, promoting alternative technologies, and enhancing technical capacity to ensure a sustainable transition away from HCFCs, in alignment with international environmental agreements and commitments to protect the ozone layer.</narrative>
  </description>
